 This package applies two patches from
 https://github.com/junglivre/pve-file-restore-ntfs3g:
 patches/ntfs-3g-dedup-plugin-fuse3.patch ports the plugin to FUSE 3 and drops
 the optional .NET hosting path; patches/ntfs-3g-dedup-plugin-large-files.patch
 reads files of any size, checks every chunk against its SHA-512 digest, and
 fails with EIO instead of returning wrong or truncated data. The patches are
 under the same license as the plugin.
